## Why This Is Asked

Tests integration with external services and resilience of orchestration under latency/outages; validates end-to-end visibility and data isolation.

## Key Concepts

- E2E with external service mocks
- Event-driven workflow orchestration
- Idempotency and retries
- Data seeds and tenant isolation
- Observability and tracing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-test outline for Playwright/Cypress
const seed = createTenantSeed('tenantA');
mockJiraAPI(seed);
mockSlackWebhook(seed);
startFlow('/api/flow', {tenant: 'tenantA', data: seed.payload});
await expect(jiraIssue(seed.issueKey)).toBeOpenOrInProgress();
await slackChannelHasMessage(seed.channel, seed.issueLink);
triggerApproval(seed.approvalId);
await expect(jiraIssue(seed.issueKey)).toHaveStatus('Done');
```

